  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Single-DGX-Spark vLLM TP1 + MTP3 profile for the 99 GiB Mia mirror of the local-inference-lab Qwen3.8 Flash Next NVFP4 checkpoint (text, image and video). The 27 GiB PLE table is served from a memory-mapped packed file built once into the platform cache, so it stays evictable page cache. The adapter bakes MiaAI-Lab's PLE offload, MXFP8, QSA FP8-KV, reduced-vocabulary MTP drafting and block-drop patches into the pinned arm64 image. Defaults follow upstream: 262144 context, FP8 KV, BF16 recurrent state, MTP 3, four sequences, 2048-token prefill chunks; contexts up to 524288 use YaRN. GPU memory utilisation 0.786 is upstream's derived budget for a 121.69 GiB host with a 26 GiB host reserve, not a measured constant. Upstream claims (not measured here): 48.7 tok/s single stream; 162.9 tok/s aggregate needs 8 streams (upstream ran max-num-seqs 8 with a 28 GiB reserve, this recipe defaults to 4).",
    "tags": [
      "multimodal",
